// Rule: [T1566.002] UAT-11985 - Google Aitm Email Qr URL
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1566.002
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR
// Required telemetry: EmailUrlInfo
// Purpose: Hunts five source-published hostnames in email and QR-code-extracted URLs.
// Logic: Evaluate EmailUrlInfo for google aitm email qr url using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result is an IOC association, not proof of credential theft, MFA bypass, account takeover, campaign attribution, or successful delivery.
// A match does not prove: Interpretation: A result is an IOC association, not proof of credential theft, MFA bypass, account takeover, campaign attribution, or successful delivery.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// UAT-11985 Google AitM infrastructure in email and QR-code URLs
// Platform: Microsoft Defender XDR Advanced Hunting
// Status: Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium (source-confirmed IOC match; IOC expiry and tenant testing required)
// Prerequisite: Microsoft Defender for Office 365 populating EmailUrlInfo
// Evidence: Cisco Talos, 2026-10-08; IOCs published in Cisco-Talos/IOCs.
// Interpretation: A result is an IOC association, not proof of credential theft,
// MFA bypass, account takeover, campaign attribution, or successful delivery.
let UAT11985Domains = dynamic([
    "google.morelessty.com",
    "jmlh.morelessty.com",
    "google.centerhoti.com",
    "google.natrlyi.com",
    "accounts.natrlyi.com"
]);
EmailUrlInfo
| where UrlDomain in~ (UAT11985Domains)
| project Timestamp, NetworkMessageId, Url, UrlDomain, UrlLocation,
          UrlChainId, UrlChainPosition, ReportId
| order by Timestamp desc
